<description>&lt;p&gt;Government forces are massing near opposition leaders' homes while rival groups have seized three towns, expanding fighting in southern and central Somalia. A UAE drone strike in Puntland killed four family members, and US agents are searching Ilhan Omar's home in a criminal investigation. Pakistani sailors freed from Somali pirates are returning home, and a market shooting in Garowe killed two and wounded four. Somali authorities are screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case, and the UN has issued an urgent appeal to protect civilians in Baidoa. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQMXEzQkZkeU1HQmlsNzFDUUhDbnVmbngtbVZGd2tZNGhjaUtzWEZqQ0pvSTF4bW16ZjljbWU2YlBkdl9OVFFJRE5xVXJoVXZCZGI4cl9ubDdrNnlpUXBiUUJLOVdKZ1hRbG52RjAyYWY2VTByS0V5a3BuYzM0dDNpZ0ViT2pNcEZ4dW1ITmFoajNwaW9zNWZLTkxQM3JRcHRwbVdGNXo0cWVEMmZsdk9jdk1xSk9xX1hqS25VTFl2QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNODRacDIweFlsNFdaY2VySjhHTVpYald2bzFwMGluQWwyYzBRTXE2c2FMaG13Z29ROXpQdFd6eThnVk5XTmJCNmt3R3BUeFJhbktLX3pKb2R3RkNsbU4xanNuc1Z4TXhZOXpMUVNhc0oyVDBJMzVhNXN5ZlVwN1FYbmFoYWlCbGJPWG5Ec0h3bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNMDdRaUdwYnpUZ09hVDdfZlhsbC1ocklGSWJYLW5ROUhBMldkd3pVenZDN25QbzFvTHdCQkVqN3RuWEJQQ2ZuQkh3SmVfaWt1WDNzcmhJYXRQRko3eWdGdlBDT0NGZXV6ajhhNTNpYmlnQnI3cDBVY1VCWkk2Q3JJSHlwN0RZTVY3d2sxSWJSdDlWU3FOWjFpcnRodw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOX2Q2eHRMZlE0XzlHOWN0UXNFZ1dQcXA5TE9OUVNELXA1dnk3ZUs0UG1uUE1XZThIUmZBN09xaEM5Rlp1Z2VSa1NJUFZjMzVscE9xTXZ3cnRsU2ZCX2pJaGdkZ2VUTTNxOTB5YkZHXzFwSW9ITFpnb3BkO